7, "t_first_chunk_s": 2164.6121373, "t_first_token_s": 2164.6121373, "t_start_s": 2164.5308412, "text": "def reverse_linked_list(head):\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses a singly linked list in place.\n\n    Args:\n    head (Node): The head of the linked list.\n\n    Returns:\n    Node: The new head of the reversed linked list.\n    \"\"\"\n    prev = None\n    current = head\n    while current:\n        # Store next node\n        next_node = current.next\n        \n        # Reverse link for current node\n        current.next = prev\n        \n        # Move prev and current one step forward\n        prev = current\n        current = next_node\n    \n    # New head is now the last node\n    return prev", "total_duration_ns": 1616505600, "ttft_s": 0.08129610000014509, "valid": true}
