49, "t_first_chunk_s": 2166.4684182, "t_first_token_s": 2166.4684182, "t_start_s": 2166.1736925, "text": "Generation splits into two phases: prefill and decode. Prefill has unrelated performance characteristics because it saturates the arithmetic units and draws power close to the board limit, whereas decode produces one token at a time, leaving most of the arithmetic units idle while the memory subsystem is pushed hard. This difference in performance characteristics makes it difficult to accurately measure the performance of the generation process using a single tokens-per-second number.", "total_duration_ns": 1324979700, "ttft_s": 0.2947257000000718, "valid": true}
